From 420eb802b2c23b49a0c37c69235284d624c477fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:55:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(motion): set the direction of parallel 3D finishing
 passes

Use the requested XY direction for parallel raster passes in the active work coordinates. Keep zero-degree paths and old project generation stamps. Expose the setting through the operation panel and MCP.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #2377
